{"3716090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drowning Ashes", "steam_appid": 3716090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/21e7fcace69ef558dccdca5b103c04c4.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where (almost) any enemy you face can become an ally! Choose from five playable heroes, and over 60 recruitable monsters; each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and equipment options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of the Capital are an unforgiving place, and you will need to choose your allies and equipment wisely to have any chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/a1dd4a54805dc67f7d19197badfa6ec7.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in Drowning Ashes are dangerous, and each encounter can pose a deadly threat to the unprepared. Learn each enemy's weaknesses, and build your perfect strategy to conquer impossible odds against deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.mp4?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit enemy weaknesses to gain additional turns, equip powerful items with their own unique skills, and develop a team of ferocious monsters to push back the curse of Ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/67936b1e2719a27a1fb370dae82c4bc0.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed and dying world full of shortcuts and hidden paths, rest at Wellsprings to restore your healing flasks, and temper the Ashes of your foes into mighty weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.mp4?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning Ashes is a turn-based monster collector at its core, but fans of the souls-like genre will find plenty of familiar tropes amidst the ruins of the Capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/e8ceea56846b288ab111846cd8b2fe37.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of the Capital are full of mysteries and secrets. How did the kingdom fall? Are your fellow survivors who they claim to be? Who are you, and why did you really come back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/ad4903d4f11e7e6719df10c8d4be7a21.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/ad4903d4f11e7e6719df10c8d4be7a21.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/ad4903d4f11e7e6719df10c8d4be7a21.mp4?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the fiends, and the terrible curse of Ash, you might even find some answers. The Capital awaits you, hero!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/21e7fcace69ef558dccdca5b103c04c4.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where (almost) any enemy you face can become an ally! Choose from five playable heroes, and over 60 recruitable monsters; each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and equipment options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/88ba0486cbf59b44394ea63138356667.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of the Capital are an unforgiving place, and you will need to choose your allies and equipment wisely to have any chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/a1dd4a54805dc67f7d19197badfa6ec7.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in Drowning Ashes are dangerous, and each encounter can pose a deadly threat to the unprepared. Learn each enemy's weaknesses, and build your perfect strategy to conquer impossible odds against deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/4d485642cab97cdd1d213242c7a38de6.mp4?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit enemy weaknesses to gain additional turns, equip powerful items with their own unique skills, and develop a team of ferocious monsters to push back the curse of Ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/67936b1e2719a27a1fb370dae82c4bc0.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed and dying world full of shortcuts and hidden paths, rest at Wellsprings to restore your healing flasks, and temper the Ashes of your foes into mighty weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/1284d60caa37ea0bc1a1d395aae8e0e6.mp4?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning Ashes is a turn-based monster collector at its core, but fans of the souls-like genre will find plenty of familiar tropes amidst the ruins of the Capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/e8ceea56846b288ab111846cd8b2fe37.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1560 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of the Capital are full of mysteries and secrets. How did the kingdom fall? Are your fellow survivors who they claim to be? Who are you, and why did you really come back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/ad4903d4f11e7e6719df10c8d4be7a21.poster.avif?t=1782672923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/ad4903d4f11e7e6719df10c8d4be7a21.webm?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/extras/ad4903d4f11e7e6719df10c8d4be7a21.mp4?t=1782672923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the fiends, and the terrible curse of Ash, you might even find some answers. The Capital awaits you, hero!</p>", "short_description": "The Ashes ignite once more, and the floodwaters rise to drown an accursed kingdom. Explore the ruins of the Capital, recruit wild monsters, and find a way to end the ruinous Cycle in this turn-based monster collector from the makers of Guile &amp; Glory: Firstborn.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/32a6bcd9a61a0575d9736c4d1197fac09a23414f/header.jpg?t=1782672923", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/0b5c9000d8b11b4894c92bf52c6bb3a97dddabe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782672923", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716090/0b5c9000d8b11b4894c92bf52c6bb3a97dddabe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782672923", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Elston Studios"], "publishers": ["Elston Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 3870280, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1308275], "package_groups": [{"nam